oyment of delusion.","j":27,"h":54,"s":57,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"57:21","t":"Race [i.e., compete] toward forgiveness from your Lord and a Garden whose width is like the width of the heavens and earth, prepared for those who believed in Allāh and His messengers. That is the bounty of Allāh which He gives to whom He wills, and Allāh is the possessor of great bounty.","j":27,"h":54,"s":57,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"57:22","t":"No disaster strikes upon the earth or among yourselves except that it is in a register before We bring it into being - indeed that, for Allāh, is easy -","j":27,"h":54,"s":57,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"57:23","t":"In order that you not despair over what has eluded you and not exult [in pride] over what He has given you. And Allāh does not like everyone self-deluded and boastful -","j":27,"h":54,"s":57,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"57:24","t":"[Those] who are stingy and enjoin upon people stinginess. And whoever turns away - then indeed, Allāh is the Free of need, the Praiseworthy.","j":27,"h":54,"s":57,"a":24,"sd":null}],"juz":27,"hizb":54,"surahs":[57],"sajdah":false}